Inverse Field is one of the fields present in Rejuvenation. It is categorized as an Magical field and can be found in the [[Grand Dream Stadium]], most notably during the battle against [[Adam]] in the Tournament Stadium.

==General Effects==

* The type chart is inverted, meaning weaknesses become resistances, and resistances and type immunities become weaknesses.

==Abilities Affected==

* Mimicry changes the user's type to Normal.

==Moves Affected==

===Field-dependent moves===

* Camouflage changes the user's type to Normal.
* Nature Power becomes Trick Room.
* Secret Power may inflict Confusion.
* Shelter halves damage from Normal-type moves.
* Terrain Pulse's type becomes Normal.

==Items==

* [[Magical Seed]] changes the user's type to Normal and changes their ability to Normalize.

==Other Notes==

* As of v13.5.6, despite what the field effect manual says, Topsy-Turvy can no longer generate nor remove this field.

